        "Why do you suggest these experiments?": [
            "1. To control for tokenization difficulty of different languages. Controlling for tokenization difficulty based on tokens per word ratio will ensure that each language is in equal footing when transferring knowledge from pretrained vocabulary to target vocabulary.",
