            "\\noindent \\textbf{\\textsc{MF}$^C_{\\textsc{Neural}}$-$*$.} We can also learn the cluster assignment and up-projections jointly. Specifically, we parameterize $\\mathbf{G}$ in Eq.~\\eqref{eq:FIG} using a neural net where we learn the indicator matrix $\\textbf{I}$ equivalently to Eq.~\\eqref{eq:gumbel}. \n",
